==Russian==
{{wikipedia|lang=ru}}
[[File:Laika.jpg|thumb|{{lang|ru|Соба́ка}}]]

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|собака}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*sobaka}}, derived from {{der|ru|ira-mid}} {{m|und|*sabāka-}}, from West Iranian *''spaka'', from {{der|ru|ira-pro|*cwā́}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ}}; compare {{noncog|gbz|tr=sabah}}, {{noncog|xme-old|σπάκα|tr=spā́kəʰ}} [the source of {{noncog|xcl|ասպակ||dog}}], {{cog|ae|𐬯𐬞𐬀𐬐𐬀|t=dog-like}}. Cognates include {{cog|uk|соба́ка}}, {{cog|be|саба́ка}}, {{cog|pl|sobaka}} {{i|dialectal}}, {{cog|csb|sobaka||bitch (female dog); dissolute man}}, {{cog|sa|शुनक|tr=śunaka}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|соба́ка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|соба́ка|a=an|adj=соба́чий|dim=соба́чка}}

# [[dog]]
#: {{syn|ru|пёс}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сторожевой|сторожева́я]] '''соба́ка'''|[[watchdog]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[дворовый|дворо́вая]] '''соба́ка'''|[[cur]], [[mongrel]], [[mutt]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вот|Вот]] [[где]] '''соба́ка''' [[зарывать|зарыта]]!|Now I see it!}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Его́]] [[каждый|ка́ждая]] '''соба́ка''' [[знать|зна́ет]]|Everyone knows him.|lit=Every dog knows him}}
#: {{uxi|ru|голо́дный как '''соба́ка'''|as hungry as a dog; [[wolfish]], [[rapacious]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|замёрзнуть как '''соба́ка'''|to be chilled to the marrow}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[злой как соба́ка]]|mad as hell|lit=vicious as a dog}}
#: {{uxi|ru|ну́жный как '''соба́ке''' пя́тая нога́|needed like a hole in the head|lit=needed like a dog needs a fifth leg}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[соба́ка на се́не]]|[[dog in the manger]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[соба́ку съесть]]|to know something inside out}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[уста́ть как соба́ка]]|to be [[dog-tired]]}}
# [[hound]]
#: {{uxi|ru|соба́ка-[[ище́йка]]|[[bloodhound]]}}
# {{lb|ru|pejorative|figuratively}} [[mongrel]], [[cur]], [[bastard]] {{gloss|a detestable person}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial|figuratively}} [[fox]] {{gloss|a clever, capable person}}
# {{lb|ru|Internet}} [[@]] ([[at sign]])
# {{lb|ru|computing|_|slang}} [[watchdog timer]]

